+## 1.6.0, keep part (2026-10-16): note-11 crisp wing thatch, slim eave lip, roll-end pointing, turret cover refine (KEEP builder, round 10)
+
+Fixes the sign-off audit of keep round 9 (director 8.6).  Every change is a new function or an optional parameter
+whose default reproduces kit 1.5.0 exactly; only the keep passes the new options (no other building imports
+`components.thatch`).
+
+### New functions
+
+- `thatch.roll_profile_scaled(sq=0.75, sv=0.80)`: the eave-roll section scaled about the eave-lip point (underside
+  stays on the 2.40 m line).
+- `thatch._point_roll_ends(...)` (private, used by `build_wing_structure(point_roll_ends=True)`): an `M_mortar` bead
+  (4 x 3.4 cm) along each W roll end's real contact line with the turret stone, plus a pointing strip (11 cm up the
+  stone, bedded 3.5 cm) over the lowest 0.35 m of the flaunching band at each roll end.
+- `thatch._eave_cover_fn(obs)` (private): builds the `FR.TUR_CULL_FN` refinement below from the built thatch.
+
+### New optional parameters (defaults = 1.5.0 behaviour)
+
+- `thatch.roll_top_mh(..., prof=None)`: another roll section.
+- `thatch.d_roll(..., butts=None, round_end=False)`: `butts=(len_rng, step_rng)` lays the roll face as bundle butts
+  (log-uniform lengths, alternating levels differing by step_rng >= 2 cm, 3 cm transitions, no crowns / bindings),
+  no butt joints on tight bends (hip corners), butts faded out before the end tapers; `round_end` shrinks the end
+  taper about the visible section's bbox centre (round end, no beak).
+- `thatch.thatch_courses(..., crisp=False, remnant_min=0.9, butt_step=(0.02, 0.03))`: with `layered`, crisp drops
+  every sub-2-cm relief (crowns, creases, inner-lobe crowns, the 0.4-1 cm crowned exposure) and gives each clump
+  its own butt thickness (neighbours differ by butt_step); bounded course remnants shorter than remnant_min sink.
+- `thatch.tuft_skirt(..., prof=None, end_fade=0.3, end_scale=1.0)`: roll section, end fade length, and (when
+  end_scale != 1) tufts <= 4 cm wide / <= 4 cm drop within end_fade of the roll ends.
+- `thatch.build_wing_roof(..., crisp=None)` / `thatch_wing_roof(..., crisp=None)`: a dict of crisp-lip options
+  (`roll`, `m0`, `butts`, `butt_step`, `taper`, `tmin`, `core_drop`, `core_eave`, `remnant_min`, `fringe`); when set
+  it also publishes `FR.ROLL_TOP_M/H` for the scaled roll and `FR.TUR_CULL_FN`.
+- `thatch.build_wing_structure(..., point_roll_ends=False)` / `thatch_junctions(..., point_roll_ends=False)`.
+- `turret.turret_cull`: if a component published `FR.TUR_CULL_FN(C, bad)`, the analytic thatch-cover cull is refined
+  by it (unset everywhere but the crisp keep, so 1.5.0 behaviour is unchanged).
+
+### Re-runs (to scratch; the deliverables were not overwritten)
+
+- tower_windmill: RERUN_MILL
+- wattle_roundhut: RERUN_HUT
+
